    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Roommate - A simple and beautiful puzzle game about roommates, with the daily life of five girls living together, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three levels of difficulty: 2x2, 2x4, and 4x4 puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;F&quot; key to turn on the black and white image when solving a puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'blank' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can quickly view girl pictures in the gallery by pressing the AD key, left and right keys or the left and right keys of the mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The puzzle picture size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The gallery picture size is 1088x960 px</p>",
